      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Let's get rid of avatar safety filters too! Interactions can go really weird when you forget to turn on avatar models, animations, and shaders.\n\nOh wait... we also have a toggle for avatar interactions...\n\n(if it wasn't clear, this is sarcasm/joke so please don't)",
