      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "In that vein, we definitely need to do away with everything but the blue Join Me status. Lots of people set themselves to orange or red, meaning other users never get to see exactly what everyone is up to at all times! How limiting! Definitely not in line with VRChat's stated stance on filtering.",
